  "html": "<section class=\"container section--services-hero pt-5\">\n\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main\">\n\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row__left\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group flow has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group h-align icon-plus-title is-layout-flex wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">    <div class=\"iconblock wp-elements-1 has-background has-secondary-background-color has-text-color has-secondary-inverse-color\" data-size=\"md\" data-padding=\"2\" data-display=\"inline\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-plumbing\" /></svg>    </div>\n\n<h1 class=\"has-link-color wp-elements-2 wp-block-post-title has-text-color has-secondary-color has-x-large-font-size\">Water Heater Flush Service in Durham, NC</h1></div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group services-hero-description flow is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<p>The main source of hot water in your home comes from the water heater. When you have a tank system, it fills the tank with water, heats it, and continues to hold it at temperature until needed. As hot water is drawn, the tank refills, and follows the same heating and holding process until the next use. With water flowing in and out of your water heater every day, sediment and minerals accumulate in the tank which, if not properly maintained, can reduce the lifespan of your system. Happy Home provides water heater flush service in Durham, NC because proper maintenance of your system removes this buildup and protects all internal components.</p>\n<p>Schedule your next water heater flush with the plumbing team at Happy Home. We&#8217;ll dispatch a plumber to your home who will arrive fully equipped to complete a successful water heater flush service.</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<div  class=\"wp-block-group mb-3 full-width-mobile schedule-and-call-cta is-content-justification-left is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-a1b15d37 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group schedule-cta-container is-vertical is-content-justification-stretch is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-41171c72 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<a href=\"/bookings\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta se-widget-button\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-event\" /></svg><span >Schedule Now</span>\n\n</a>\n\n    <p class=\"horizon-text has-secondary-font-family wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\">or speak with an expert!</p>\n\n<a href=\"tel:+13362819025\" aria-label=\"Call now: +13362819025\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta phone-link\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-phone\" /></svg><span data-show-on=\"desktop\">(336) 281-9025</span>\n        <span data-show-on=\"mobile\">Call Now</span>\n</a>\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color has-secondary-font-family has-small-font-size text-center wp-elements-3 wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\"><strong>Same Day Appointments Available by Phone</strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div><!-- ./left -->\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row__right\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile box-shadow-lg border-radius-lg\" >\n    <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\t\t\t<figure class=\"wp-block-post-featured-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\" src=\"/images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Services-technician-retrieving-tools-from-the-service-truck.jpg\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"A Happy Home Services technician retrieving tools from the service truck\" style=\"object-fit:cover;\" srcset=\"/images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Services-technician-retrieving-tools-from-the-service-truck.jpg 1920w, /images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Services-technician-retrieving-tools-from-the-service-truck-300x200.jpg 300w, /images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Services-technician-retrieving-tools-from-the-service-truck-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Services-technician-retrieving-tools-from-the-service-truck-768x512.jpg 768w, /images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Services-technician-retrieving-tools-from-the-service-truck-1536x1024.jpg 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1010px) 100vw, (max-width: 1440px) 50vw, 768px\" /></figure>\n\t\t\t</div>\n</div>\t\t\t</div><!-- ./right -->\n\t\t</div><!-- ./row -->\n\n</div>\n\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main section--services-hero__main--empty has-background has-secondary-background-color\"></div>\n\n</section>\n<!-- container /--><div id=\"types-of-services\" class=\"types-of-service-container container py-5 wp-elements-4 has-custom-acf-color has-background has-secondary-background-color has-text-color has-primary-inverse-color\"><!-- wp-block-columns/ -->\n        <div data-num-of-columns=\"2\" class=\"wp-block-columns mb-4 is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-layout-1 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n    <!-- column/ -->\n        <div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n            <div class=\"types-of-service__icon-title\">\n                    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"0\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-maintenance\" /></svg>    </div>\n                                        <h2 class=\"h3 text-left mt-0 font-size-5\">Flushing Hard Water Minerals &amp; Scale to Stop Heating Element Burnout</h2>\n                                    </div>\n                            <div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col flex-grow\">\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 whitespace-normal break-words text-start [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"746c1a74-d33a-430f-b380-ff0d533f30f0\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-4o\">\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\">\n<div class=\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert dark\">\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col flex-grow\">\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 whitespace-normal break-words text-start [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"991b3d25-687a-43a6-bbe6-6e0d9e348da2\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-4o\">\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\">\n<div class=\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert dark\">\n<p>As minerals and sediment accumulate in your water heater, they settle to the bottom. This forces your system to work harder because the burner must now get through a layer of sediment to heat your water properly. Additionally, without a routine water heater flush, your system has a higher risk of corrosion, leaks, and poor water quality. All this contributes to a shortened lifespan and higher energy bills. Benefits of getting a water heater flush include:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Extends tank lifespan</li>\n<li>Restores consistent hot water delivery</li>\n<li>Eliminates rumbling and popping noises</li>\n<li>Improves water clarity and quality</li>\n</ul>\n<p>At Happy Home, we recommend getting a water heater flush once a year. This keeps your system operating at peak efficiency while you enjoy constant hot water year-round. Homes with hard water can reduce sediment at the source with a <a href=\"/services/plumbing/water-softeners\">water softener</a>, and <a href=\"/services/tankless-water-heaters\">tankless water heaters</a> are descaled rather than flushed.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n                            </div><!-- ./column -->\n        <!-- column/ -->\n        <div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n            <div class=\"types-of-service__icon-title\">\n                    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"0\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-technician\" /></svg>    </div>\n                                        <h2 class=\"h3 text-left mt-0 font-size-5\">Licensed Plumbers Offering Water Heater Flush Service in Durham, NC, and the Surrounding Research Triangle Region</h2>\n                                    </div>\n                            <div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col flex-grow\">\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 whitespace-normal break-words text-start [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"b2a198db-ff41-4713-909b-49c19f848a7d\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-4o\">\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\">\n<div class=\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert dark\">\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col flex-grow\">\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 whitespace-normal break-words text-start [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"e0f7c3b9-47cd-43d9-8458-8de88b0250d6\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-4o\">\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\">\n<div class=\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert dark\">\n<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"964\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Experience superior water heater flush services with Happy Home Services in Durham, NC, where we provide top-quality solutions tailored to meet your home&#8217;s unique needs. Our team of skilled plumbers specializes in expert water heater flush services, ensuring that every aspect of your <a href=\"/services/plumbing\">plumbing system</a> runs smoothly. We pride ourselves on our commitment to customer satisfaction, offering transparent pricing and personalized solutions that address your specific concerns. As a trusted local provider, we understand the importance of a well-functioning water heater for your daily comfort and convenience. Our goal is to exceed your expectations with our prompt response times and quality workmanship, making us your go-to choice for all <a href=\"/services/plumbing/water-heater-repairs-maintenance\">water heater needs</a> in Durham and surrounding areas. Contact us today to schedule your service and experience the difference when working with a professional team dedicated to keeping your home&#8217;s plumbing in top shape! When a flush reveals a tank that is corroding or leaking, our <a href=\"/services/plumbing/water-heater-installation-replacements\">water heater installation and replacement</a> team quotes the replacement so you can compare.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n                            </div><!-- ./column -->\n        </div><!-- ./ wp-block-columns --> </div><!-- ./container -->\n<div class=\"our-promise container \" id=\"our-promise\">\n<div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile box-shadow-lg border-radius-lg\">\n\n<figure class=\"our-promise__photo\">\n<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"427\" src=\"/images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Service-technician-working-on-a-toilets-plumbing-1024x683.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"A Happy Home Services technician working on a toilets plumbing\" srcset=\"/images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Service-technician-working-on-a-toilets-plumbing-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Service-technician-working-on-a-toilets-plumbing-300x200.jpg 300w, /images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Service-technician-working-on-a-toilets-plumbing-768x512.jpg 768w, /images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Service-technician-working-on-a-toilets-plumbing-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, /images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Service-technician-working-on-a-toilets-plumbing.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" /></figure>\n<div class=\"our-promise__info\">\n    <p class=\"h3 our-promise__info__headline\">Licensed Plumbers Offering Plumbing Solutions in Durham, NC and Surrounding Research Triangle Region</p>\n    <div class=\"our-promise__info__description\">Experience superior plumbing services with Happy Home Services in Durham, NC, where we are dedicated to providing top-quality solutions tailored to meet your home’s unique needs. Our team of skilled plumbers specializes in expert installations and fast, reliable repairs, ensuring that every aspect of your plumbing system runs smoothly. Whether you’re dealing with a leaky faucet, a clogged drain, or require a complete plumbing overhaul, we have the expertise to deliver efficient and dependable service every time. We pride ourselves on our commitment to customer satisfaction, offering transparent pricing and personalized solutions that address your specific concerns. As a trusted local provider, we understand the importance of a well-functioning plumbing system for your daily comfort and convenience. Our goal is to exceed your expectations with our prompt response times and quality workmanship, making us your go-to choice for all plumbing needs in Durham and surrounding areas. Contact us today to schedule your service and experience the difference of working with a professional team dedicated to keeping your home’s plumbing in top shape!</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div  class=\"container splitter makes-and-models has-background has-white-background-color\" style=\"--CTX-container-split-size: 0.5\"