/02/rheem.png\" class=\"logogrid-image\" alt=\"Rheem logo\" srcset=\"/images/2024/02/rheem.png 225w, /images/2024/02/rheem-150x150.png 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 225px) 100vw, 225px\" /></div>        </li>\n            <li class=\"logogrid-item\">\n            <div class=\"logogrid-wrap\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"88\" src=\"/images/2024/02/Mitsubishi-Electric-logo-300x88.png\" class=\"logogrid-image\" alt=\"Mitsubishi Electric logo an HVAC partner in Durham, NC\" srcset=\"/images/2024/02/Mitsubishi-Electric-logo-300x88.png 300w, /images/2024/02/Mitsubishi-Electric-logo-768x226.png 768w, /images/2024/02/Mitsubishi-Electric-logo.png 851w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></div>        </li>\n            <li class=\"logogrid-item\">\n            <div class=\"logogrid-wrap\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"57\" src=\"/images/2024/02/Water-Furnace-logo-300x57.png\" class=\"logogrid-image\" alt=\"Water Furnace logo an HVAC partner in Durham, NC\" srcset=\"/images/2024/02/Water-Furnace-logo-300x57.png 300w, /images/2024/02/Water-Furnace-logo-768x147.png 768w, /images/2024/02/Water-Furnace-logo.png 1024w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></div>        </li>\n        </ul>\n</div>\n\n            <h6 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\">\n                And Dozens More\n            </h6></div>\n\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<div  class=\"splitter-column splitter-column--right splitter-column--center py-3 has-custom-acf-color has-background has-secondary-background-color has-text-color has-secondary-inverse-color wp-elements-5\">\n    <div class=\"splitter-column-inner splitter-column-inner--contained splitter-column-inner--padded\">\n\n    <h2 class=\"wp-block-heading mb-3\">Qualified for All Major Makes and Models</h2>\n\n    <div class=\"wp-block-group flow mb-2 has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n    <p>Our team of expert technicians is trained to handle all makes and models of major brands with precision and care. From routine maintenance to complex repairs, we ensure top-notch service for all.</p>\n\n    </div>\n\n<div  class=\"iconlist\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-iconsize=\"md\">\n    <ul role=\"list\">\n                <li class=\"iconlist-item\">\n            <svg class=\"icon iconlist-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-check\" /></svg>            <div class=\"iconlist-text\">\n                <p class=\"iconlist-label\"></p>\n                <p class=\"iconlist-description\"><p>Ensure optimal efficiency of all your systems</p>\n</p>\n            </div>\n        </li>\n                <li class=\"iconlist-item\">\n            <svg class=\"icon iconlist-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-check\" /></svg>            <div class=\"iconlist-text\">\n                <p class=\"iconlist-label\"></p>\n                <p class=\"iconlist-description\"><p>Lower your utility costs with energy efficiency</p>\n</p>\n            </div>\n        </li>\n                <li class=\"iconlist-item\">\n            <svg class=\"icon iconlist-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-check\" /></svg>            <div class=\"iconlist-text\">\n                <p class=\"iconlist-label\"></p>\n                <p class=\"iconlist-description\"><p>Extend your system’s lifespan through regular maintenance</p>\n</p>\n            </div>\n        </li>\n                <li class=\"iconlist-item\">\n            <svg class=\"icon iconlist-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-check\" /></svg>            <div class=\"iconlist-text\">\n                <p class=\"iconlist-label\"></p>\n                <p class=\"iconlist-description\"><p>Keep you and your family comfortable and safe during all seasons</p>\n</p>\n            </div>\n        </li>\n            </ul>\n</div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n</div><div id=\"our-certifications\" class=\"container certifications-and-awards py-5\">\n    <h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center mb-4 d-inline-block h-decorator h-decorator--primary\">Our Certifications & Awards</h2>\n<div  class=\"logocarousel\" style=\"--count: 2;\" data-logo-count=\"2\">\n    <div class=\"logocarousel--inner-container\">\n        <ul role=\"list\" class=\"logocarousel-list\" style=\"--logo-count:2;\">\n                                <li class=\"logocarousel-item\">\n                        <div class=\"logocarousel-wrap\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"249\" height=\"245\" src=\"/images/2024/03/OnCallAir-Customer-First-Award-Winner.png\" class=\"logocarousel-image\" alt=\"OnCallAir Customer First Award Winner\" sizes=\"(max-width: 680px) 150px, (max-width: 820px) 128px, (max-width: 1024px) 100px, 128px\" /></div>                    </li>\n                                    <li class=\"logocarousel-item\">\n                        <div class=\"logocarousel-wrap\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"252\" height=\"250\" src=\"/images/2024/03/North-American-Technician-Excellence-logo-NATE.png\" class=\"logocarousel-image\" alt=\"North American Technician Excellence logo (NATE) given to Happy Home in Durham, NC\" sizes=\"(max-width: 680px) 150px, (max-width: 820px) 128px, (max-width: 1024px) 100px, 128px\" srcset=\"/images/2024/03/North-American-Technician-Excellence-logo-NATE.png 252w, /images/2024/03/North-American-Technician-Excellence-logo-NATE-150x150.png 150w\" /></div>                    </li>\n                        </ul>\n    </div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div id=\"FAQs\" class=\"wp-block-group py-5 flow has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">FAQs</h2>\n\n<div  class=\"accordion\" style=\"--_accordion-separator-color: #076395\">\n            <details class=\"accordion-item\" data-custom-open=\"true\" open>\n            <summary class=\"accordion-title | paired-icon-text\">\n                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--closed | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevrondown\" /></svg>                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--open | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronup\" /></svg>                <p class=\"paired-text\">Why does my water heater make a popping or rumbling noise?</p>\n            </summary>\n\n            <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n                <div class=\"accordion-content-inner\">\n                    <p>Water trapped beneath the sediment layer boils and pushes through it. The noise means the sediment is thick enough to matter, and a flush removes it. A heater that has never been flushed after many years may have hardened sediment that does not drain fully, which we will tell you during the visit.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </details>            <details class=\"accordion-item\">\n            <summary class=\"accordion-title | paired-icon-text\">\n                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--closed | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevrondown\" /></svg>                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--open | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronup\" /></svg>                <p class=\"paired-text\">Can a flush damage an old water heater?</p>\n            </summary>\n\n            <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n                <div class=\"accordion-content-inner\">\n                    <p>Rarely, and the risk is worth knowing. A tank that has gone many years without a flush can have a drain valve that will not seal again, or corrosion that a flush exposes. Our plumber inspects the tank first and tells you if it is a candidate for replacement instead.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </details>            <details class=\"accordion-item\">\n            <summary class=\"accordion-title | paired-icon-text\">\n                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--closed | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevrondown\" /></svg>                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--open | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronup\" /></svg>                <p class=\"paired-text\">Does flushing help with rusty or discolored hot water?</p>\n            </summary>\n\n            <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n                <div class=\"accordion-content-inner\">\n                    <p>Sometimes. Discoloration from settled sediment clears after a flush. Discoloration that persists points to a corroding tank interior or a spent anode rod, which the inspection identifies.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </details>    </div>\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"maintenance-financing\" class=\"container splitter splitter--uniform-height-stick-last\" style=\"--CTX-container-split-size: 0.5\">\n\n<div  class=\"splitter-column splitter-column--left splitter-column--start has-background has-primary-background-color\">\n    <div class=\"splitter-column-inner splitter-column-inner--contained splitter-column-inner--padded\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group flow w100 has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-2468f3b8 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\"><div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile w100 border-radius-lg\" >\n    <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full has-custom-border w100\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"/images/2024/04/NU-Bullman-Stock-37-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"Clamp meter on HVAC unit\" class=\"wp-image-5359\" style=\"border-radius:0px\" srcset=\"/images/2024/04/NU-Bullman-Stock-37-scaled.jpg 2560w, /images/2024/04/NU-Bullman-Stock-37-300x200.jpg 300w, /images/2024/04/NU-Bullman-Stock-37-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /images/2024/04/NU-Bullman-Stock-37-768x512.jpg 768w, /images/2024/04/NU-Bullman-Stock-37-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, /images/2024/04/NU-Bullman-Stock-37-2048x1365.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" /></figure>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading mt-3 has-primary-inverse-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-6\">Happy Home Service VIP Club</h2>\n\n<p class=\"has-primary-inverse-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-7 wp-block-paragraph\">What You Receive with Our VIP Maintenance Club:</p>\n\n<ul class=\"has-primary-inverse-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-block-list wp-elements-8\">\n<li>Up to 25% Discount on Repairs</li>\n\n<li>Up to an additional 25% discount on parts and labor</li>\n\n<li>Same Day Service</li>\n\n<li>Triple Labor Warranty</li>\n\n<li>50% off Minimum Service Fee</li>\n\n<li>$50 Yearly Rebate</li>\n\n<li>Flexible Payment Options</li>\n\n<li>Convenient Service Reminders</li>\n\n<li>Your 13th Month Free when you join or renew your one-year plan</li>\n</ul>\n\n<a href=\"/maintenance\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"outline\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta full-width-mobile\">\n    <span >Learn More</span>\n        <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronright\" /></svg>\n</a></div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div  class=\"splitter-column splitter-column--right splitter-column--start\">\n    <div class=\"splitter-column-inner splitter-column-inner--contained splitter-column-inner--padded\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group flow has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\"><div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile border-radius-lg\" >\n    <div 